# Configure PUBLIC_ORIGIN in wrangler.jsonc before production deployment.
PUBLIC_ORIGIN=https://webui.example.com

# npm run dev uses the real local Workers runtime at http://127.0.0.1:8088.
# Durable Object state persists under .wrangler/state; Redis is not used.
# CHANNELS and SESSIONS are SQLite-backed Durable Object bindings.
# Both peers establish outbound WebSockets; there is no forced connection rotation.
# The plugin sends a heartbeat every 2s; its active lease expires after 6s.
# Cipher keys exist only in the plugin and the editor URL fragment / tab storage.
# Never configure a shared cipher key as a Worker variable or store it in a DO.
